{"id": 1, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？突然查起户口来了？[MSG_BREAK]格兰特利·贝尔，虎兽人。身高一米八六，体重九十一公斤，生日十月二十。[MSG_BREAK]问这么细干嘛，你该不会要送我什么东西吧？", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 60, "total_tokens": 3226, "prompt_tokens": 2909, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 257}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.34}
{"id": 1, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "我是格兰特利·贝尔。虎兽人，身高 186 公分，体重 91 公斤。\n[MSG_BREAK]\n生日是 10 月 20 日。突然打听这个干嘛，打算请我吃顿好的？", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 58, "total_tokens": 2321, "prompt_tokens": 2034, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 229}}, "elapsed_seconds": 4.04}
{"id": 2, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "不是刚入学，我现在都已经是二年级了。[MSG_BREAK]刚来骑士学院那会儿才是一年级，现在早就习惯这儿的生活了。怎么突然问起这个？", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "total_tokens": 2269, "prompt_tokens": 2030, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 199}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.03}
{"id": 2, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？你看我像那种什么都不懂的雏儿吗？[MSG_BREAK]虽然确实是一年级……但我好歹是土生土长的城里人，刚进学院那会儿，亚戈那乡下小子连路都认不全，全是我带着到处转的。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 63, "total_tokens": 3377, "prompt_tokens": 2905, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 409}}, "elapsed_seconds": 4.26}
{"id": 3, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？什么原室友，谁在到处乱造谣啊。我现在就跟亚戈住一间屋啊。[MSG_BREAK]那乡下小子每天晚上睡得跟死猪一样，早上还得我踹他床板才起得来。真要是\"原室友\"我还省心了呢，可惜现在一睁眼对面还是他。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 77, "total_tokens": 3560, "prompt_tokens": 2910, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 573}}, "elapsed_seconds": 4.56}
{"id": 3, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "我现在还是跟亚戈住一间。新学期分宿舍的时候，他重新选了我当室友。[MSG_BREAK]至于为什么有人叫我“原室友”，是因为一年级刚入学那会儿我俩就是同寝。到了二年级他其实也可以选提奥，在选了提奥的那边，我不就成“以前的室友”了。不过论先来后到，最开始跟他住一起的本来就是我。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 97, "total_tokens": 2941, "prompt_tokens": 2035, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 809}}, "elapsed_seconds": 5.42}
{"id": 4, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？你脑子里都在想些什么乱七八糟的玩意儿啊？[MSG_BREAK]先不说哪来那么多人挤一间屋子，我和亚戈交往？！交往个鬼啊！[MSG_BREAK]那家伙就是个刚进城什么都不懂的笨蛋，我顺手带带他而已，谁要跟那小子扯上那种关系啊，少到处听些莫名其妙的谣言！", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 94, "total_tokens": 3558, "prompt_tokens": 2913, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 551}}, "elapsed_seconds": 5.46}
{"id": 4, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哪有这种事。二代选室友又不是只有我一个，也可以选提奥。[MSG_BREAK]而且我和亚戈就是室友和好朋友，谁跟你说我们在交往了？别瞎传奇怪的话啊。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 50, "total_tokens": 2388, "prompt_tokens": 2038, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 300}}, "elapsed_seconds": 7.63}
{"id": 5, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "都是同一个人啊。\nGrantly Bell 就是我，中文叫格兰特利还是格兰特尼纯粹看怎么音译而已。\n[MSG_BREAK]\n至于亚戈跟艾尔戈，指的也都是跟我同屋的那个乡下小子。反正怎么叫都是他，名字翻译拐了个弯而已，别纠结那几个字了。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 78, "total_tokens": 3720, "prompt_tokens": 2919, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 723}}, "elapsed_seconds": 5.86}
{"id": 5, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "都是同一个人。\n\n格蘭特尼、格兰特利和 Grantly Bell 都是指我，只是中文翻译用的字不太一样而已。[MSG_BREAK]艾尔戈和亚戈也一样，都是指亚戈。看不同地方或者不同版本的翻译时经常会碰到这种差别，习惯了就好。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 67, "total_tokens": 2256, "prompt_tokens": 2044, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 145}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.78}
{"id": 6, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？你认真的？\n我可是正儿八经的城里人，弗罗汀是个城市，不是什么学校名！学校叫骑士学院好不好。[MSG_BREAK]亚戈那家伙才是乡下出来的，刚入学那会儿什么都不懂，还是我带的他。你怎么连这都能搞反啊。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 70, "total_tokens": 3344, "prompt_tokens": 2913, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 361}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.64}
{"id": 6, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "完全搞反了。亚戈才是从乡下渔村来的，我是城里长大的。\n[MSG_BREAK]\n弗罗汀是我老家那座城市的名字，不是学校。我们念的这里就叫骑士学院。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 51, "total_tokens": 2317, "prompt_tokens": 2038, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 228}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.7}
{"id": 7, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "喜欢的事那可多了，运动、练剑、骑马，还有大口吃饭——只要能动起来或者吃饱肚子的我都喜欢。[MSG_BREAK]至于讨厌的，头一个就是闷在屋里读书，还有一直待着不准动，光是想想都浑身难受。洗澡也挺麻烦的，虽然每天还是得洗就是了。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 80, "total_tokens": 2235, "prompt_tokens": 2028, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 127}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.68}
{"id": 7, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "喜欢的就那些啊，剑术、骑马、到处活动，当然还有大口吃肉。反正只要能动起来的我都乐意。[MSG_BREAK]至于讨厌的……别让我坐在那看书或者发呆，待着不动简直要命。还有洗澡也烦，一身毛弄湿了重得要死，麻烦死了。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 75, "total_tokens": 3256, "prompt_tokens": 2903, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 278}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.82}
{"id": 8, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？全国骑马冠军？谁跟你扯这种鬼话的啊！[MSG_BREAK]虽然我的骑术确实挑不出什么毛病，但哪来那么离谱的头衔，我自己怎么都不知道？别随便给我编履历啊哈哈哈。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 56, "total_tokens": 3338, "prompt_tokens": 2908, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 374}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.76}
{"id": 8, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "你这是打哪儿听来的谣言啊？[MSG_BREAK]我确实挺喜欢骑马的，但根本没拿过什么全国冠军，连正经比赛展示身手的机会都还没碰上呢。[MSG_BREAK]要是哪天学院或者城里真办了比赛，我倒是不介意去拿个第一回来给你看。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 76, "total_tokens": 2449, "prompt_tokens": 2033, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 340}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.46}
{"id": 9, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？你脑子里就这两种极端啊？[MSG_BREAK]我就是单纯看那些密密麻麻的字犯困，谁有闲心故意装傻。再说了，要是骑马和挥剑也能算考试，我早就拿第一了，少拿书本那套来量我。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 67, "total_tokens": 3299, "prompt_tokens": 2916, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 316}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.32}
{"id": 9, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "谁跟你说的只有这两种可能？我就是单纯讨厌一直坐着翻书，闷得要死，这跟脑子好不好使是两码事。[MSG_BREAK]我也不是什么装傻的天才，没那么玄乎。遇到不懂的我自然会去问、去弄明白，用不着给自己编这种设定。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 72, "total_tokens": 2457, "prompt_tokens": 2041, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 344}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.53}
{"id": 10, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？死敌？你想太多了吧，那家伙也就是成天摆着张臭脸让人不爽而已，算哪门子死敌啊。[MSG_BREAK]第一次见就是刚入学那会儿，我们仨——我、亚戈还有他，挤在同一辆进学院的马车上。一路上他架子摆得老大，规矩还多得要命，当时我就觉得绝对跟这人合不来。[MSG_BREAK]不过合不来归合不来，真遇到事也没见他掉过链子就是了。……啧，虽然平时看他那副正经样子我还是嫌烦。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 136, "total_tokens": 3359, "prompt_tokens": 2916, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 307}}, "elapsed_seconds": 4.09}
{"id": 10, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "谁跟他是死敌啊，没那么夸张。单纯就是性格合不来，看事情想法差太多，经常三两句话就呛起来而已。[MSG_BREAK]第一次见他是刚入学那会儿，在来骑士学院的马车上碰到的。当时就觉得这家伙难搞，到现在也差不多还是那样。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 71, "total_tokens": 2452, "prompt_tokens": 2041, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 340}}, "elapsed_seconds": 4.0}
{"id": 11, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "不是，他们可不是学生。[MSG_BREAK]戴德里克是教官，西利欧更不用说了，是校长兼教官。平时训起人来可没手软过。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "total_tokens": 2270, "prompt_tokens": 2033, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 195}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.95}
{"id": 11, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "是同届没错啊。戴德里克那家伙一进来就分去穿红衣服了，成天板着张脸的优等生少爷，看着都替他累。[MSG_BREAK]西利欧也是这届的。怎么，你突然打听他俩干嘛？", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 62, "total_tokens": 4427, "prompt_tokens": 2908, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1457}}, "elapsed_seconds": 8.11}
{"id": 12, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？带别人一起穿墙？你当我是什么移动门扉啊，怎么可能做得到。[MSG_BREAK]我的能力顶多就我自己能穿过去，平时拿来抄近道或者从门板钻出来吓吓奥斯卡还差不多。碰一下带人一起穿……哪来的离谱传闻，我自己怎么都不知道。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 75, "total_tokens": 3691, "prompt_tokens": 2918, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 698}}, "elapsed_seconds": 5.62}
{"id": 12, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "官方目前明确写出来的，其实只有二代介绍里提过我会想用自己的 E.P. 和亚戈一起搞恶作剧而已。[MSG_BREAK]至于什么隐形、穿墙、碰一下能不能带人一起穿这些具体的生效机制，大部分都是二手讨论里传的，目前根本没有官方明确的设定说明。所以这还不算核实过的官设。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 83, "total_tokens": 2488, "prompt_tokens": 2043, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 362}}, "elapsed_seconds": 6.58}
{"id": 13, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "关于我觉醒 E.P. 的具体经过和当时的战斗，官方档案里其实根本没有写过这段剧情，我不能自己编一段打斗来糊弄你。\n\n[MSG_BREAK]\n\n至于“学院第一”——学院里压根没有官方排过什么战力第一，我也从来没拿过这种头衔。平时大家对练各有胜负，吹这种大话没什么意义。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 88, "total_tokens": 2385, "prompt_tokens": 2038, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 259}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.08}
{"id": 13, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？觉醒E.P.？你从哪听来这些奇奇怪怪的词的，听都没听过。[MSG_BREAK]至于学院第一……真要单挑或者比剑术，我可不会轻易认输。但要是把那些让人想睡觉的文化课也算进去，啧，谁稀罕争那破名头。[MSG_BREAK]比起纠结什么第一不第一的，不如去剑术场多挥两百次剑来得痛快。怎么，你很在意这个？", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 111, "total_tokens": 4242, "prompt_tokens": 2913, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1218}}, "elapsed_seconds": 8.95}
{"id": 14, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "一口气问这么多啊。不过这些事在官方资料里根本没有写过，我自己没法瞎编给你。\n[MSG_BREAK]\n我爸妈叫什么、家里具体做什么生意，还有胸口这道疤到底是怎么来的，目前都没有确切的设定和出处。所以实话实说，我确实不知道。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 72, "total_tokens": 2337, "prompt_tokens": 2040, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 225}}, "elapsed_seconds": 2.69}
{"id": 14, "variant": "before", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "哈？你查户口呢，上来就问这么多。[MSG_BREAK]我家弗罗汀的，普通人家，具体做啥没必要跟你报备吧。至于胸口这道……以前打架弄的，谁还专门记着是谁留的啊。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 58, "total_tokens": 3337, "prompt_tokens": 2915, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 364}}, "elapsed_seconds": 3.91}
{"id": 15, "variant": "after", "model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "provider": "cornna", "settings": {"temperature": 0.4, "max_tokens": 1200}, "output": "这两个在官方资料里其实都没有确切记录。[MSG_BREAK]我的生日是 10 月 20 日，但具体几岁官方从来没公开过；至于声优，目前也完全没有官方配音演员的信息。", "finish_reason": "stop", "returned_model": "gemini-3.7-flash-tiered", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 51, "total_tokens": 2660, "prompt_tokens": 2030, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 579}}, "elapsed_seconds": 4.24}
